# Icon_Skull - defeat / enemy marker on panels and cards. Warm bone, dark sockets drawn in the line colour, teeth as
# sel-out notches (no outline round the features). Light from the top-left: glint on the dome, shadow down the right.
size 16 16
symmetric x
key
  K #28161c  outline and sockets
  B #f2e6c8  bone
  b #cdb894  bone shadow
  d #9a8062  deep shadow, teeth notches
  H #fffbee  light on the dome
